{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1000_p", "source_sha256": "296f5fa09a33efa2618b0175da30ce03ffab3330d6299990c50fcd98ce684c9d", "ja": "（今日はなんと、本物のお城を借りてのPV撮影！\nひなたと真の姿が見えないけど、どこにいるのかな？）", "zh": "（今天居然要借用真正的城堡来拍摄PV！不过看不到日向和真，她们去哪儿了呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "533d786110a72aabfa21ad27e11eb0fe0be37acdb1ccec193a29f870ed27d4a6", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nごめんねぇ、遅くなってしまって。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n对不起呀，让你久等了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4a8d512d75dc9b9a363ca502150471556472bd5857e42cc9b6275ef14b51713c", "ja": "おっと……ひなた、お帰り。\nあれ？　真は一緒じゃなかったのか？", "zh": "哦……日向，欢迎回来。\n咦？真没和你一起吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "289baf268b834afadf0e5939df53c327971f00fde07fae96b407e60063c99b08", "ja": "真さんは、お化粧を直してもらってるよぉ。\nもうじき撮影でしょや？", "zh": "真正在请人补妆哦。马上就要拍摄了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "cc435e4d1b42eb3d45fd9400092d9ff13964f0a5c277c4dfe724c122d4f50029", "ja": "間に合ってよかったよぉ。ふたりで散歩してたら、\n帰り道がわからなくなってしまってねぇ……。", "zh": "能赶上真是太好了。两个人一起散步的时候，结果找不到回去的路了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6f4f84f959610b95d5b12bf936fac52b2500e4a67f3364ee700ef7d84bbb8efd", "ja": "え、そうだったのか？\n連絡してくれたらよかったのに。", "zh": "诶，原来是这样吗？\n你联系我一下不就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "6be411d3e0b07d14378e0f833afc63d1b361c5a9570abda63cb7b1019778fa7d", "ja": "{$P$}は、もしかしたら\n打ち合わせをしてるかもと思ったもんだから。", "zh": "因为我想着{$P$}说不定\n正在开会呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "d3b7946b461a39f9219e2199b61589ec964d512b02538a0bc3487f1be671a55b", "ja": "でも、ふたりで何とか帰ってこられたよぉ！\n冒険みたいで、ちょっこし楽しかったべさ……えへへ。", "zh": "不过，我们俩还是想办法回来了哟！\n感觉就像冒险一样，稍微有点开心……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1008_p", "source_sha256": "cab2dcd30a6406613e2c034f08e4a4d174a3190774dbc56410ab211636c6c309", "ja": "それならよかったけど……ここって、\nかなり入り組んでるみたいだしな。怖くなかったか？", "zh": "那就好……不过这里似乎挺错综复杂的。你没害怕吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "0b348ca1f2b9edd226abda40e15b4aac8d8e753afa8c2565bc215c70144234ec", "ja": "うん、最初は心細く感じたけども、\n真さんがすぐそばにいてくれたし……。", "zh": "嗯，一开始是觉得挺不安的，\n不过真小姐就在我身旁……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "83dda7fc4acb0269c9a975c81c305c16a2fae88ba19e74b193365c4a48833b42", "ja": "それに……真さんのことは、あたしが守らねば！\nって思ったら、勇気が湧いてきたんだわ。", "zh": "而且……我还想着，得由我来保护真才行！这么一想，勇气就涌上来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "f77e0409eb370e8874190a2243386c3b672ec8e449d92d231796d3815cce03fe", "ja": "ふふ♪　真さんにも、苦手なものがあるんだねぇ。\nなんだか、身近に感じてしまったべさ。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪原来真也有不擅长的东西呀。\n感觉一下子觉得她亲近了不少呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0dc0081ec979bc16a3f546ef70d1259fb7b6aea59871bda5fec6cd362d4e4402", "ja": "ああ、真はお化けとか幽霊は苦手だから……。\nひなたが居てくれて、真も助かっただろうな。", "zh": "啊，真不擅长应付鬼怪和幽灵之类的……  \n有小阳在身边，真也总算得救了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "db846eb8d40ca06e194601156f74d25f3667921bb8d055d8978d9007a15dc376", "ja": "なんもなんも！　あたしの方こそ、心強かったから。\nとにかく、撮影に遅れなくてよかったよぉ。", "zh": "没事没事！反倒是我，有你在才觉得安心呢。\n总之，没耽误拍摄真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3e8ddc6997f4466c19ad80fffa7b68cc0a956396945a681e1f96a92fc00339df", "ja": "そうだな。ええと……この後は、\nひなたと真が対決するシーンだったかな。", "zh": "是啊。呃……接下来是日向和真对决的场景，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "26fc399a3b8e0cb5a11d715a6a3f26da5ece5d7a377e02359bb6719ae4e551b2", "ja": "そうだねぇ。役の話ではあるけども……。\n真さんと真剣勝負できるなんて、うれしいねぇ。", "zh": "是啊。虽然只是剧情里的角色……但能和真小姐来一场认真较量，真让人高兴呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f31546828175327188e86f8c3490f6769f700565ffc1c2301590bd15fdbf2065", "ja": "真の演技に呑まれないように、気を付けてな。\n今のひなたなら、大丈夫そうだけど。", "zh": "可别被真出色的演技压住了啊。\n不过，现在的日向应该没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "a860a07232e870c68d1d7c3bc836d25380344bf8194da67b1703ce327063bf82", "ja": "えへへ。さっき、真さんとたくさんお話ししてねぇ。\nあたしとの勝負が楽しみって、言ってくれて。", "zh": "嘿嘿，刚才我和真小姐聊了好多呢。\n她还说很期待和我一决胜负。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "2cb9f0ec829ab3f341f654fa6c4b08d82549acee7b492f59f43df0024dc6a933", "ja": "あたしで務まるか、わからんけども……。\nでも、真さんと一緒なら、できると思うんだわ。", "zh": "不知道我能不能胜任……不过，只要和真小姐一起，我觉得一定能做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "bd4d37b734e3a8091194801972555ff14fc39ec8b4c6bac117794daec803f9d1", "ja": "馴れ合いとか、遠慮とかじゃなくて。\n本気でぶつかって、カッコよくなれるって。", "zh": "不是互相迁就，也不是客气。就是要认真碰撞，才能变得帅气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "b91ac823f67c7af4cb2c9c174ed53684a7a0a1d59aca1a998eaefcfc70a990b0", "ja": "{$P$}も、そう思ったから、\nこの歌をあたしたちに歌わせてくれたんでしょや？", "zh": "{$P$}也是这么想的，\n所以才会让我们唱这首歌的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1021_p", "source_sha256": "109428d8bc1692b6770a3eb771aa2fafa0bda531fc5f167547d54b49bb80e1ad", "ja": "ひなた……ああ、その通りだ！\nふたりなら、できると思ったからだよ。", "zh": "日向……啊，没错！\n因为我觉得你们两个人一起就能做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "8669a44de6d887a2613360da862f131077be3b2af28287ceab6a373e30960aeb", "ja": "えへへ。したっけあたし、行ってくるよぉ。\n見ててねぇ、{$P$}！", "zh": "嘿嘿。那么我就出发啦。看好了哦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0284_1023_p", "source_sha256": "f3d9b3842885e286c0e980e6b918cce97e15a98600132341055189ee9990253b", "ja": "（ひなたの瞳に、聖なる炎が揺れている……。\nふたりの対決、目が離せないものになりそうだな！）", "zh": "（神圣的火焰在小日向的眼中摇曳着……。\n两人的对决，看来会变得让人目不转睛了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
